WEBVTT

00:27:28.121 --> 00:27:31.413
into the world, you're you're happy with
the creative choices you've made,

00:27:31.413 --> 00:27:32.538
regardless of the feedback?

00:27:33.288 --> 00:27:37.663
Well, all I see when I work on something
is the thing that we could have

00:27:37.663 --> 00:27:41.538
and should have done to make this
better or that different.

00:27:41.746 --> 00:27:44.246
The rethinking doesn't stop because
it's it's out there.

00:27:44.246 --> 00:27:48.954
And I do think that one of the
enemies of certainly movies

00:27:48.954 --> 00:27:52.121
and in some cases TV is
the sort of, you know,

00:27:52.121 --> 00:27:54.788
the announced release date where

00:27:54.913 --> 00:28:00.704
the time that one normally should
have to rethink doesn't exist.